{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Glimvale \u2665</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glimvale is a peaceful idle game where your world continuously evolves. Build and decorate your own cosy MMO village in this relaxing city-builder where life goes on, even when you\u2019re away. Watch your village grow, fill with adventurers, and slowly transform into a lively fantasy haven at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/5244bd8c0f396f2680207532adcde10f.avif?t=1771425000\" width=600 height=168 /></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE ADVENTURERS HAPPY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your village flourish as adventurers arrive and make themselves at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit skilled craftsmen, create places of entertainment, and build small dungeons while Paladins, Mages, and Thieves happily wander through your town. Train your adventurers, help them gain experience and gold, and live the adventurer\u2019s life they all deserve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A VILLAGE FULL OF PERSONALITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 A Latte Caf\u00e9 Tavern ? You got it !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda Book staircases ? Absolutely !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc34 A collection of fantastic mounts ? For sure !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd58 Customisation for every building ? Yes !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECORATE YOUR LITTLE VILLAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a charming village where adventurers can craft items, cook delicious meals, collect mascots, and explore cosy dungeons. Decorate the environment freely, place small details, and design a welcoming world that feels truly alive and truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/9d1f8164094c9dff5ff40251ade42889.poster.avif?t=1771425000\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/9d1f8164094c9dff5ff40251ade42889.webm?t=1771425000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/9d1f8164094c9dff5ff40251ade42889.mp4?t=1771425000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Cosy idle city-builder with high replay value</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Create and customise your own adorable fantasy town with more than 300 decorations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Manage buildings by customising their production</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 A relaxing idle experience with no stress and no time limits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Watch your village come to life (even offline) and build others adventurer villages as you progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403590?t=1771425000","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771425000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/2590b06add701c7eb66a61262f90679ae3c94e55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771425000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/2590b06add701c7eb66a61262f90679ae3c94e55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771425000","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"desc