and explore cosy dungeons. Decorate the environment freely, place small details, and design a welcoming world that feels truly alive and truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/9d1f8164094c9dff5ff40251ade42889.poster.avif?t=1771425000\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/9d1f8164094c9dff5ff40251ade42889.webm?t=1771425000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/9d1f8164094c9dff5ff40251ade42889.mp4?t=1771425000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Cosy idle city-builder with high replay value</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Create and customise your own adorable fantasy town with more than 300 decorations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Manage buildings by customising their production</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 A relaxing idle experience with no stress and no time limits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Watch your village come to life (even offline) and build others adventurer villages as you progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Milkshake Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/header.jpg?t=1771425000","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Glimvale : My Mini Overworld. Developed by Milkshake Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/